OL,3,GNEWSABeavers to return to River Ness
OL,4,Aarea after 500 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FBeavers are set to be released into the
OL,7,Fwaters around Loch Ness, 500 years
OL,8,Fafter they were last recorded there.
OL,10,FNatureScot has approved the release of
OL,11,Fup to 15 beavers over three years at
OL,12,Fagreed sites in the River Ness
OL,13,Fcatchment.
OL,15,FTheir assessment concluded that beavers
OL,16,Fcould "significantly boost
OL,17,Fbiodiversity" in the catchment, with
OL,18,Fthe landscape at "low risk of negative
OL,19,Fimpacts from beaver activity."
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
